# Parsing :

COMMAND : > file
-BASH : create file
-MINISHELL : nothing

COMMAND : < file
-BASH : file: No such file or directory
-MINISHELL : nothing

-BASH : touch test | chmod 000 test | ./test
result :	./test: No such file or directory
			chmod: cannot access 'test': No such file or directory
-MINISHELL :
result : 	./test: No such file or directory
			test is chmod 000

